{"lineas":[{"speaker":"David","start":0,"end":8.8,"text":"Alice, I've been staring at this one black-and-white photograph for two days straight, and I'm not exaggerating when I say it genuinely gave me chills.","words":[{"w":"Alice,","s":0,"e":0.64},{"w":"I've","s":0.64,"e":0.88},{"w":"been","s":0.88,"e":0.96},{"w":"staring","s":0.96,"e":1.28},{"w":"at","s":1.28,"e":1.52},{"w":"this","s":1.52,"e":1.68},{"w":"one","s":1.68,"e":1.92},{"w":"black-and-white","s":1.92,"e":2.64},{"w":"photograph","s":2.64,"e":3.2},{"w":"for","s":3.2,"e":3.52},{"w":"two","s":3.52,"e":3.76},{"w":"days","s":3.76,"e":4},{"w":"straight,","s":4,"e":4.72},{"w":"and","s":4.88,"e":5.04},{"w":"I'm","s":5.04,"e":5.28},{"w":"not","s":5.28,"e":5.44},{"w":"exaggerating","s":5.44,"e":6.08},{"w":"when","s":6.08,"e":6.4},{"w":"I","s":6.4,"e":6.56},{"w":"say","s":6.56,"e":6.72},{"w":"it","s":6.72,"e":6.96},{"w":"genuinely","s":6.96,"e":7.52},{"w":"gave","s":7.52,"e":7.92},{"w":"me","s":7.92,"e":8.08},{"w":"chills.","s":8.08,"e":8.8}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":8.96,"end":17.115,"text":"Okay, you sound weirdly intense about a photo, which honestly worries me a little, because last time it was a picture of a competitive eater.","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":8.96,"e":9.6},{"w":"you","s":9.6,"e":9.92},{"w":"sound","s":9.92,"e":10.24},{"w":"weirdly","s":10.24,"e":10.72},{"w":"intense","s":10.72,"e":11.12},{"w":"about","s":11.12,"e":11.36},{"w":"a","s":11.36,"e":11.52},{"w":"photo,","s":11.52,"e":12.16},{"w":"which","s":12.16,"e":12.4},{"w":"honestly","s":12.4,"e":12.8},{"w":"worries","s":12.8,"e":13.28},{"w":"me","s":13.28,"e":13.52},{"w":"a","s":13.52,"e":13.68},{"w":"little,","s":13.68,"e":14.08},{"w":"because","s":13.995,"e":14.395},{"w":"last","s":14.395,"e":14.795},{"w":"time","s":14.795,"e":14.955},{"w":"it","s":14.955,"e":15.195},{"w":"was","s":15.195,"e":15.355},{"w":"a","s":15.355,"e":15.435},{"w":"picture","s":15.435,"e":15.755},{"w":"of","s":15.755,"e":15.835},{"w":"a","s":15.835,"e":15.995},{"w":"competitive","s":15.995,"e":16.475},{"w":"eater.","s":16.475,"e":17.115}]},{"speaker":"David","start":17.355,"end":28.555,"text":"Fair. But this one's different. It's Boston, 1967, mid-marathon, and a race official is literally lunging at a runner, trying to physically rip the number off her back.","words":[{"w":"Fair.","s":17.355,"e":17.995},{"w":"But","s":18.075,"e":18.235},{"w":"this","s":18.235,"e":18.475},{"w":"one's","s":18.475,"e":18.795},{"w":"different.","s":18.795,"e":19.355},{"w":"It's","s":19.515,"e":19.755},{"w":"Boston,","s":19.755,"e":20.555},{"w":"1967,","s":20.555,"e":21.875},{"w":"mid-marathon,","s":21.875,"e":23.195},{"w":"and","s":23.195,"e":23.355},{"w":"a","s":23.355,"e":23.515},{"w":"race","s":23.515,"e":23.835},{"w":"official","s":23.835,"e":24.315},{"w":"is","s":24.315,"e":24.635},{"w":"literally","s":24.635,"e":25.115},{"w":"lunging","s":25.115,"e":25.515},{"w":"at","s":25.515,"e":25.675},{"w":"a","s":25.675,"e":25.835},{"w":"runner,","s":25.835,"e":26.235},{"w":"trying","s":26.235,"e":26.715},{"w":"to","s":26.715,"e":26.875},{"w":"physically","s":26.875,"e":27.275},{"w":"rip","s":27.275,"e":27.515},{"w":"the","s":27.515,"e":27.675},{"w":"number","s":27.675,"e":27.995},{"w":"off","s":27.995,"e":28.155},{"w":"her","s":28.155,"e":28.315},{"w":"back.","s":28.315,"e":28.555}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":29.16,"end":38.84,"text":"Wait, her back? Hold on. So the scandal, the actual emergency that made a grown man jump into a marathon, was that a woman was running?","words":[{"w":"Wait,","s":29.16,"e":29.8},{"w":"her","s":29.8,"e":30.12},{"w":"back?","s":30.12,"e":30.68},{"w":"Hold","s":30.92,"e":31.32},{"w":"on.","s":31.32,"e":31.8},{"w":"So","s":31.96,"e":32.2},{"w":"the","s":32.2,"e":32.44},{"w":"scandal,","s":32.44,"e":33.16},{"w":"the","s":33.16,"e":33.4},{"w":"actual","s":33.4,"e":33.8},{"w":"emergency","s":33.8,"e":34.36},{"w":"that","s":34.36,"e":34.52},{"w":"made","s":34.52,"e":34.76},{"w":"a","s":34.76,"e":34.92},{"w":"grown","s":34.92,"e":35.16},{"w":"man","s":35.16,"e":35.4},{"w":"jump","s":35.4,"e":35.72},{"w":"into","s":35.72,"e":36.04},{"w":"a","s":36.04,"e":36.2},{"w":"marathon,","s":36.2,"e":36.92},{"w":"was","s":37.08,"e":37.32},{"w":"that","s":37.32,"e":37.48},{"w":"a","s":37.48,"e":37.72},{"w":"woman","s":37.72,"e":37.96},{"w":"was","s":37.96,"e":38.2},{"w":"running?","s":38.2,"e":38.84}]},{"speaker":"David","start":39.24,"end":49.565,"text":"Exactly that. Her name was Kathrine Switzer, twenty years old, and back then the Boston Marathon had no rule imagining women, because nobody thought they'd dare enter.","words":[{"w":"Exactly","s":39.24,"e":39.72},{"w":"that.","s":39.72,"e":40.28},{"w":"Her","s":40.44,"e":40.68},{"w":"name","s":40.68,"e":40.92},{"w":"was","s":40.92,"e":41.08},{"w":"Kathrine","s":41.08,"e":41.56},{"w":"Switzer,","s":41.56,"e":42.28},{"w":"twenty","s":42.36,"e":42.76},{"w":"years","s":42.76,"e":43},{"w":"old,","s":43,"e":43.24},{"w":"and","s":43.565,"e":43.805},{"w":"back","s":43.805,"e":44.045},{"w":"then","s":44.045,"e":44.285},{"w":"the","s":44.285,"e":44.525},{"w":"Boston","s":44.525,"e":44.845},{"w":"Marathon","s":44.845,"e":45.405},{"w":"had","s":45.405,"e":45.645},{"w":"no","s":45.645,"e":45.885},{"w":"rule","s":45.885,"e":46.125},{"w":"imagining","s":46.125,"e":46.685},{"w":"women,","s":46.685,"e":47.325},{"w":"because","s":47.485,"e":47.725},{"w":"nobody","s":47.725,"e":48.205},{"w":"thought","s":48.205,"e":48.445},{"w":"they'd","s":48.445,"e":48.685},{"w":"dare","s":48.685,"e":48.925},{"w":"enter.","s":48.925,"e":49.565}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":49.725,"end":62.23,"text":"So she signed the form as K.V. Switzer, just initials, and the organizers mailed her bib number 261 without ever suspecting a thing. That's deliciously sneaky.","words":[{"w":"So","s":49.725,"e":50.125},{"w":"she","s":50.125,"e":50.365},{"w":"signed","s":50.365,"e":50.765},{"w":"the","s":50.765,"e":50.925},{"w":"form","s":50.925,"e":51.245},{"w":"as","s":51.245,"e":51.485},{"w":"K.V.","s":51.485,"e":52.045},{"w":"Switzer,","s":52.045,"e":52.765},{"w":"just","s":52.765,"e":53.085},{"w":"initials,","s":53.085,"e":53.885},{"w":"and","s":54.045,"e":54.205},{"w":"the","s":54.205,"e":54.365},{"w":"organizers","s":54.365,"e":55.005},{"w":"mailed","s":55.005,"e":55.405},{"w":"her","s":55.405,"e":55.565},{"w":"bib","s":55.565,"e":55.805},{"w":"number","s":55.805,"e":56.125},{"w":"261","s":56.125,"e":57.83},{"w":"without","s":57.83,"e":58.31},{"w":"ever","s":58.31,"e":58.63},{"w":"suspecting","s":58.63,"e":59.19},{"w":"a","s":59.19,"e":59.35},{"w":"thing.","s":59.35,"e":59.91},{"w":"That's","s":60.23,"e":60.63},{"w":"deliciously","s":60.63,"e":61.43},{"w":"sneaky.","s":61.43,"e":62.23}]},{"speaker":"David","start":62.63,"end":73.59,"text":"Sneaky, but not even intentional — she always signed that way, like a writer. Then around mile two, this official named Jock Semple spots her and just snaps.","words":[{"w":"Sneaky,","s":62.63,"e":63.19},{"w":"but","s":63.19,"e":63.43},{"w":"not","s":63.43,"e":63.67},{"w":"even","s":63.67,"e":63.91},{"w":"intentional","s":63.91,"e":64.79},{"w":"—","s":64.79,"e":64.87},{"w":"she","s":64.87,"e":65.11},{"w":"always","s":65.11,"e":65.51},{"w":"signed","s":65.51,"e":65.83},{"w":"that","s":65.83,"e":66.07},{"w":"way,","s":66.07,"e":66.63},{"w":"like","s":66.63,"e":66.87},{"w":"a","s":66.87,"e":67.03},{"w":"writer.","s":67.03,"e":67.67},{"w":"Then","s":67.99,"e":68.31},{"w":"around","s":68.31,"e":68.63},{"w":"mile","s":68.63,"e":69.03},{"w":"two,","s":69.03,"e":69.67},{"w":"this","s":69.75,"e":69.99},{"w":"official","s":69.99,"e":70.47},{"w":"named","s":70.47,"e":70.79},{"w":"Jock","s":70.79,"e":71.27},{"w":"Semple","s":71.27,"e":71.91},{"w":"spots","s":71.91,"e":72.31},{"w":"her","s":72.31,"e":72.55},{"w":"and","s":72.55,"e":72.79},{"w":"just","s":72.79,"e":73.11},{"w":"snaps.","s":73.11,"e":73.59}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":74.095,"end":82.335,"text":"And this is the moment the camera catches, right? Describe it to me slowly, because I want to feel exactly how ugly those three seconds got.","words":[{"w":"And","s":74.095,"e":74.335},{"w":"this","s":74.335,"e":74.495},{"w":"is","s":74.495,"e":74.655},{"w":"the","s":74.655,"e":74.735},{"w":"moment","s":74.735,"e":74.975},{"w":"the","s":74.975,"e":75.215},{"w":"camera","s":75.215,"e":75.615},{"w":"catches,","s":75.615,"e":76.255},{"w":"right?","s":76.415,"e":77.055},{"w":"Describe","s":77.055,"e":77.535},{"w":"it","s":77.535,"e":77.695},{"w":"to","s":77.695,"e":77.855},{"w":"me","s":77.855,"e":78.015},{"w":"slowly,","s":78.015,"e":78.735},{"w":"because","s":78.735,"e":79.055},{"w":"I","s":79.055,"e":79.215},{"w":"want","s":79.215,"e":79.455},{"w":"to","s":79.455,"e":79.535},{"w":"feel","s":79.535,"e":79.855},{"w":"exactly","s":79.855,"e":80.255},{"w":"how","s":80.255,"e":80.495},{"w":"ugly","s":80.495,"e":80.815},{"w":"those","s":80.815,"e":81.135},{"w":"three","s":81.135,"e":81.375},{"w":"seconds","s":81.375,"e":81.775},{"w":"got.","s":81.775,"e":82.335}]},{"speaker":"David","start":82.735,"end":88.655,"text":"Semple leaps off the press truck, grabs her shoulder, and screams at her to get out of his race and hand over that number.","words":[{"w":"Semple","s":82.735,"e":82.775},{"w":"leaps","s":82.735,"e":83.055},{"w":"off","s":83.055,"e":83.215},{"w":"the","s":83.215,"e":83.375},{"w":"press","s":83.375,"e":83.615},{"w":"truck,","s":83.615,"e":84.255},{"w":"grabs","s":84.255,"e":84.655},{"w":"her","s":84.655,"e":84.815},{"w":"shoulder,","s":84.815,"e":85.455},{"w":"and","s":85.455,"e":85.695},{"w":"screams","s":85.695,"e":86.095},{"w":"at","s":86.095,"e":86.255},{"w":"her","s":86.255,"e":86.415},{"w":"to","s":86.415,"e":86.495},{"w":"get","s":86.495,"e":86.655},{"w":"out","s":86.655,"e":86.815},{"w":"of","s":86.815,"e":86.975},{"w":"his","s":86.975,"e":87.135},{"w":"race","s":87.135,"e":87.455},{"w":"and","s":87.455,"e":87.695},{"w":"hand","s":87.695,"e":87.935},{"w":"over","s":87.935,"e":88.255},{"w":"that","s":88.255,"e":88.415},{"w":"number.","s":88.415,"e":88.655}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":89.2,"end":90.8,"text":"In front of the photographers.","words":[{"w":"In","s":89.2,"e":89.44},{"w":"front","s":89.44,"e":89.6},{"w":"of","s":89.6,"e":89.76},{"w":"the","s":89.76,"e":89.84},{"w":"photographers.","s":89.84,"e":90.8}]},{"speaker":"David","start":90.8,"end":97.92,"text":"In front of everyone. Her face in the photo is pure terror. But she keeps running. She refuses to step off the road.","words":[{"w":"In","s":90.8,"e":90.96},{"w":"front","s":90.96,"e":91.2},{"w":"of","s":91.2,"e":91.36},{"w":"everyone.","s":91.36,"e":92},{"w":"Her","s":92.16,"e":92.4},{"w":"face","s":92.4,"e":92.64},{"w":"in","s":92.64,"e":92.8},{"w":"the","s":92.8,"e":92.88},{"w":"photo","s":92.88,"e":93.28},{"w":"is","s":93.28,"e":93.44},{"w":"pure","s":93.44,"e":93.84},{"w":"terror.","s":93.84,"e":94.48},{"w":"But","s":94.56,"e":94.72},{"w":"she","s":94.72,"e":94.96},{"w":"keeps","s":94.96,"e":95.2},{"w":"running.","s":95.2,"e":95.84},{"w":"She","s":95.92,"e":96.08},{"w":"refuses","s":96.08,"e":96.64},{"w":"to","s":96.64,"e":96.8},{"w":"step","s":96.8,"e":97.04},{"w":"off","s":97.04,"e":97.2},{"w":"the","s":97.2,"e":97.36},{"w":"road.","s":97.36,"e":97.92}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":97.92,"end":100.88,"text":"She stood her ground. Literally, in this case.","words":[{"w":"She","s":97.92,"e":98.08},{"w":"stood","s":98.08,"e":98.32},{"w":"her","s":98.32,"e":98.56},{"w":"ground.","s":98.56,"e":99.12},{"w":"Literally,","s":99.2,"e":99.92},{"w":"in","s":99.92,"e":100.16},{"w":"this","s":100.16,"e":100.32},{"w":"case.","s":100.32,"e":100.88}]},{"speaker":"David","start":101.6,"end":108.825,"text":"Ooh, nice one. To stand your ground — to refuse to back down when someone pressures you. Usually it's not literal at all.","words":[{"w":"Ooh,","s":101.6,"e":101.64},{"w":"nice","s":101.6,"e":101.92},{"w":"one.","s":101.92,"e":102.16},{"w":"To","s":102.425,"e":102.665},{"w":"stand","s":102.665,"e":102.905},{"w":"your","s":102.905,"e":103.145},{"w":"ground","s":103.145,"e":103.705},{"w":"—","s":103.705,"e":103.745},{"w":"to","s":103.705,"e":103.865},{"w":"refuse","s":103.865,"e":104.265},{"w":"to","s":104.265,"e":104.425},{"w":"back","s":104.425,"e":104.665},{"w":"down","s":104.665,"e":104.985},{"w":"when","s":104.985,"e":105.225},{"w":"someone","s":105.225,"e":105.625},{"w":"pressures","s":105.625,"e":106.025},{"w":"you.","s":106.025,"e":106.585},{"w":"Usually","s":106.825,"e":107.465},{"w":"it's","s":107.465,"e":107.545},{"w":"not","s":107.545,"e":107.785},{"w":"literal","s":107.785,"e":108.185},{"w":"at","s":108.185,"e":108.345},{"w":"all.","s":108.345,"e":108.825}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":108.825,"end":116.025,"text":"Right, like if your boss pushes you to work weekends and you calmly say no, you're standing your ground. No marathons required.","words":[{"w":"Right,","s":108.825,"e":109.305},{"w":"like","s":109.305,"e":109.625},{"w":"if","s":109.625,"e":109.785},{"w":"your","s":109.785,"e":109.945},{"w":"boss","s":109.945,"e":110.265},{"w":"pushes","s":110.265,"e":110.665},{"w":"you","s":110.665,"e":110.825},{"w":"to","s":110.825,"e":110.905},{"w":"work","s":110.905,"e":111.145},{"w":"weekends","s":111.145,"e":111.625},{"w":"and","s":111.625,"e":111.865},{"w":"you","s":111.865,"e":112.025},{"w":"calmly","s":112.025,"e":112.425},{"w":"say","s":112.425,"e":112.665},{"w":"no,","s":112.665,"e":113.225},{"w":"you're","s":113.305,"e":113.545},{"w":"standing","s":113.545,"e":113.865},{"w":"your","s":113.865,"e":114.105},{"w":"ground.","s":114.105,"e":114.745},{"w":"No","s":114.745,"e":114.985},{"w":"marathons","s":114.985,"e":115.545},{"w":"required.","s":115.545,"e":116.025}]},{"speaker":"David","start":116.48,"end":123.84,"text":"And here's the twist — she wasn't alone. Her boyfriend Tom Miller was running beside her, and he happened to be a hammer thrower.","words":[{"w":"And","s":116.48,"e":116.72},{"w":"here's","s":116.72,"e":117.04},{"w":"the","s":117.04,"e":117.2},{"w":"twist","s":117.2,"e":117.